    [`in-/im-/il-/ir-`], [多见于拉丁形成的既有词], [invisible, dishonest, nonsense],
    [`a-/an-`], [多见于希腊形成的既有词], [atypical, amoral, apathetic],
  )

#strong[跨来源构词]：`un-` + acceptable / scientific / constitutional;`a-` + moral

